fix(shortcuts): enable drag-and-drop activation and drop on idle tab

Fix inability to add .lnk shortcuts via external drag & drop from Explorer:
- Subscribe PointerRegionBehavior to DragEnter and DragLeave for DataFormats.FileDrop so dragging over the idle tab arms and expands the bar (since Windows suppresses MouseEnter/MouseLeave during OLE DoDragDrop).
- Bind ShortcutDragDropBehavior.ExternalDropCommand on TabBorder in MainWindow.xaml so AllowDrop=True is active on the idle tab as well.
- Add UseShellExecute fallback in ShortcutLauncher when a .lnk has an empty TargetPath (e.g., shell/UWP shortcuts) while keeping faithful TargetPath/Arguments/WorkingDirectory execution.
- Add regression tests (480/480 passing) and update docs/plan/ESTADO.md.

Refs: RF04, HU04 (CA #1), E5-CA1, E5-CA2